      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then why does it look different?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "The Moon doesn't make its own light. It shines because sunlight lights it up, like a flashlight on a ball.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "☀️",
        "text": "Sunlight lights it up",
        "cue": "sunlight",
        "sub": "Like a flashlight",
        "sub_cue": "flashlight"
